{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 2, "text": "规民约中，努力培育和弘扬中华民族的优良传统精神，使“乡规民约”能更好地作为国家", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 262, "w": 1552, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "规民约中，努力培育和弘扬中华民族的优良传统精神，使“乡规民约”能更好地作为国家", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 262, "w": 1552, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 3, "text": "法律和规章制度的补充，发挥其独特的社会调节作用。重点应在“乡规碑”中大力发扬", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 326, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "法律和规章制度的补充，发挥其独特的社会调节作用。重点应在“乡规碑”中大力发扬", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 326, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 4, "text": "“朋友”一伦，突出朋友有信及其现代的积极意义。", "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 390, "w": 880, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“朋友”一伦，突出朋友有信及其现代的积极意义。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 137, "y": 390, "w": 880, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 5, "text": "秧佑地方《乡规碑》提出几不准：", "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 463, "w": 567, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "秧佑地方《乡规碑》提出几不准：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 221, "y": 463, "w": 567, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 6, "text": "不准赌博贪婪，诱惑孺子；不准窝藏招匪，致偷设害；不准勾引刀棍，凭空讹", "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 531, "w": 1303, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不准赌博贪婪，诱惑孺子；不准窝藏招匪，致偷设害；不准勾引刀棍，凭空讹", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 531, "w": 1303, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 7, "text": "诈；不准嗾使词讼，波害良家；不准估淫人妻，活夺妇女；不准持尊凌卑，凶行磕", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 595, "w": 1383, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "诈；不准嗾使词讼，波害良家；不准估淫人妻，活夺妇女；不准持尊凌卑，凶行磕", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 595, "w": 1383, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 8, "text": "索。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 656, "w": 92, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "索。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 656, "w": 92, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 9, "text": "马黑寨“乡规碑”也提出几不许：", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 720, "w": 559, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "马黑寨“乡规碑”也提出几不许：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 720, "w": 559, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 10, "text": "不许赌钱；不许掳抢孤单；不许调戏人家妇女；不许游手好闲；不许窝藏巫", "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 789, "w": 1299, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "不许赌钱；不许掳抢孤单；不许调戏人家妇女；不许游手好闲；不许窝藏巫", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 789, "w": 1299, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 11, "text": "类；不许偷鸡盗狗；不许做贼反告。②", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 849, "w": 627, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "类；不许偷鸡盗狗；不许做贼反告。②", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 849, "w": 627, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 12, "text": "坝达地方“乡规碑”提出“勤农耕”、“俭持家”、“无偷盗”的社会理想，其碑文云：", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 909, "w": 1379, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "坝达地方“乡规碑”提出“勤农耕”、“俭持家”、“无偷盗”的社会理想，其碑文云：", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 909, "w": 1379, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 13, "text": "吾乡•••勤俭各为家风，朝出耕以仰资侍父毋，暮入息聚议场圃桑林。要", "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 986, "w": 1303, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "吾乡•••勤俭各为家风，朝出耕以仰资侍父毋，暮入息聚议场圃桑林。要", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 306, "y": 986, "w": 1303, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 14, "text": "以后相劝，绿绿明月到处犬无声，堪称仁厚乏俗。③", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1046, "w": 868, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以后相劝，绿绿明月到处犬无声，堪称仁厚乏俗。③", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1046, "w": 868, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 15, "text": "此外，布依族还有一种特别的“护林碑”，此碑把保护山林、环境作为一种社会规范确", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1106, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，布依族还有一种特别的“护林碑”，此碑把保护山林、环境作为一种社会规范确", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1106, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 16, "text": "定下来，促进了人与自然的和谐发展。如兴义顶效一带的“护林碑”（咸丰五年立）说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 140, "y": 1168, "w": 1488, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "定下来，促进了人与自然的和谐发展。如兴义顶效一带的“护林碑”（咸丰五年立）说：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 140, "y": 1168, "w": 1488, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 17, "text": "窃思天地之钟灵，诞生贤哲；山川之毓秀，代产英豪。是以惟岳降神，赖此", "bbox_px": {"x": 310, "y": 1243, "w": 1295, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "窃思天地之钟灵，诞生贤哲；山川之毓秀，代产英豪。是以惟岳降神，赖此", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 310, "y": 1243, "w": 1295, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 18, "text": "朴械之气所郁结而成也，然山深，必因乎水茂；而人杰，必赖乎地灵。以此之故，", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1308, "w": 1387, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "朴械之气所郁结而成也，然山深，必因乎水茂；而人杰，必赖乎地灵。以此之故，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1308, "w": 1387, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 19, "text": "众寨公议，近来因屋后两山牧放牲畜，草木因之濯濯，掀开石厂，巍石遂成嶙峋，", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1372, "w": 1383, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "众寨公议，近来因屋后两山牧放牲畜，草木因之濯濯，掀开石厂，巍石遂成嶙峋，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1372, "w": 1383, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 20, "text": "举目四顾，不甚叹惜。于是齐集与岑姓面议，办钱十千，木品与众永人为后代，", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1436, "w": 1387, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "举目四顾，不甚叹惜。于是齐集与岑姓面议，办钱十千，木品与众永人为后代，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1436, "w": 1387, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 21, "text": "于后代培植树木，禁止开挖，庶几龙脉丰满，人物咸兴。④", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1497, "w": 969, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "于后代培植树木，禁止开挖，庶几龙脉丰满，人物咸兴。④", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1497, "w": 969, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 22, "text": "这段碑文反映出布依族对中国传统“天人合一”思想的继承和发展，但布依族人民又", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1561, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这段碑文反映出布依族对中国传统“天人合一”思想的继承和发展，但布依族人民又", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 1561, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 23, "text": "不像汉儒、宋儒那样停留在对“天人合一”的玄思妙想上，而是把“天人一体”的思想落实", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1625, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不像汉儒、宋儒那样停留在对“天人合一”的玄思妙想上，而是把“天人一体”的思想落实", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1625, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 24, "text": "到指导现实生活和生产实践的层次上。他们认为人的成长和发展，离不开与大自然的和", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1690, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "到指导现实生活和生产实践的层次上。他们认为人的成长和发展，离不开与大自然的和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1690, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 127, "line_no": 25, "text": "谐统一。", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1758, "w": 149, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "谐统一。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 1758, "w": 149, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
